WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:06.140
So what it was like working with Jacques, man, in a word, eye-opening,

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:12.560
I'm always really reluctant when I see people that claim double or

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.820
triple the amount of clients you get with half the work.

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.800
My first thought is always, nah, I get it, like snake oil salesmen,

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:22.700
this is the modern version of that.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:29.400
And it kind of upsets me how wrong I was, literally a couple of phone

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.680
calls with Jacques, a couple of work sections, and immediately started

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:40.260
seeing the ROI, yeah, could not recommend him or his company highly

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.940
enough. So cheers, Jacques, thanks.
